{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":37099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"020f6ae7e5b80a7a557dc700b81808e2","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Also need to verify header state: the header built up to inst('9:21') then I removed loginBtn, created loginWrap etc. But the error occurred at line 77: `heroBg.fills=[bgFill]` — that's in the hero section, meaning the entire header was created successfully. Good. Note `tfInst.x=656+60-656` line for ffbT — that was after error point, not executed.\n\nWait — actually the error was at line 77 which is `if (bgFill.type==='IMAGE') { bgFill.scaleMode='FILL'...`? The scaleMode assignment on the copied fill object. Actually fills returns a copy, so mutation does nothing, but the error says 'scaleMode' is read-only — assigning to a property of the readonly copy throws. So everything before that executed: heroBg created and resized. Then error aborted the rest. Header fully built.\n\nNow rebuild hero with proper FILL scaleMode at creation: get the fills array, set on the copy, then assign back — that's the standard pattern: `const f = node.fills[0]; f.scaleMode='FILL'; node.fills=[f];` — this works because assigning to copy then writing back. But the error said scaleMode read-only... The copy object may have a read-only setter in plugin sandbox? Actually the standard documented approach IS to clone via JSON.parse(JSON.stringify()) since fills returns readonly objects. Right — Figma returns frozen Paint objects. Use JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(fills)), mutate, assign back.\n\nAlso for the heroBg instance: it's an instance of Photo_Hero_Background component (an image fill at component level). resize on an instance scales proportionally in Figma (instances can't be resized non-uniformly... actually instances CAN be resized arbitrarily since 2022? Setting resize on instance with aspect ratio constraints... Instances resize freely unless constraints). Since the component is an image-fill rectangle, resizing the instance distorts the image unless scaleMode CROP. Better approach: set instance fills to IMAGE with scaleMode FILL via the cloned-paint trick.\n\nLet me rebuild hero now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2939614a-de6b-46ec-9e1f-7271638640fe","uuid":"8c831069-4daf-426b-8427-7faf034e3f66","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:22:17.084Z","thinking_duration_ms":10811}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":37099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"020f6ae7e5b80a7a557dc700b81808e2","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Header is built; hero needs rebuild with frozen-paint-safe image handling."}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2939614a-de6b-46ec-9e1f-7271638640fe","uuid":"ebf3f575-59c2-44ce-8d55-45e83e1d8fcb","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:22:17.706Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":37099,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"020f6ae7e5b80a7a557dc700b81808e2","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_22_2071c7cf","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Source Sans Pro', style:'Regular'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Source Sans Pro', style:'Bold'});\nfunction inst(id, x, y, parent, w) {\n  const c = figma.getNodeById(id);\n  const i = c.createInstance();\n  parent.appendChild(i);\n  i.x = x; i.y = y;\n  if (w && i.width !== w) i.resize(w, i.height * w / i.width);\n  return i;\n}\nfunction instCover(id, x, y, w, h, parent) {\n  const c = figma.getNodeById(id);\n  const i = c.createInstance();\n  parent.appendChild(i);\n  const fills = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(i.fills));\n  if (fills.length && fills[0].type==='IMAGE') { fills[0].scaleMode='FILL'; i.fills=fills; }\n  i.resize(w, h);\n  i.x = x; i.y = y;\n  return i;\n}\nfunction text(parent, str, fontSize, style, color, x, y) {\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName = {family:'Source Sans Pro', style};\n  t.fontSize = fontSize;\n  t.characters = str;\n  t.fills = [{type:'SOLID', color}];\n  t.x = x; t.y = y;\n  parent.appendChild(t);\n  return t;\n}\nfunction rect(parent, x, y, w, h, fill, radius) {\n  const r = figma.createRectangle();\n  r.x = x; r.y = y; r.resize(w, h);\n  r.fills = fill ? [{type:'SOLID', color: fill}] : [];\n  if (radius) r.cornerRadius = radius;\n  parent.appendChild(r);\n  return r;\n}\nconst ORANGE={r:0.94509804,g:0.44705883,b:0.15686275}, YELLOW={r:1,g:0.70196078,b:0.05490196},\n  INK={r:0.14509804,g:0.15294118,b:0.16862745}, GRAY={r:0.39215686,g:0.39607843,b:0.42352941},\n  LIGHT={r:0.61960784,g:0.61960784,b:0.65098039}, WHITE={r:1,g:1,b:1};\n\nconst secHero = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:4');\nconst heroCon = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:16');\n\n// Background photo full-bleed\nconst heroBg = instCover('9:55', 0, 0, 1920, 720, secHero);\n// warm wash over left two-thirds\nconst overlay = rect(secHero, 0, 0, 1150, 720, YELLOW, 0);\noverlay.opacity = 0.85;\n// keep content on top\nsecHero.appendChild(heroCon);\n\n// Headline\ntext(heroCon, 'Are you starving?', 68, 'Bold', INK, 0, 0);\ntext(heroCon, 'Within a few clicks, find meals that are accessible near you', 26, 'Regular', GRAY, 0, 96);\n\n// Search card\nconst card = figma.createFrame();\ncard.name='Hero Search Card';\ncard.resize(880, 300);\ncard.x=0; card.y=176;\ncard.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:WHITE}];\ncard.cornerRadius=16;\ncard.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.5,g:0.3,b:0.05,a:0.15},offset:{x:0,y:24},radius:48,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\nheroCon.appendChild(card);\n// Tabs\nconst tabDel = figma.createFrame();\ntabDel.name='Tab · Delivery (current)';\ntabDel.resize(180,64); tabDel.x=24; tabDel.y=24;\ntabDel.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:YELLOW}]; tabDel.cornerRadius=10;\ncard.appendChild(tabDel);\ninst('9:10', 20, 20, tabDel, 24);\ntext(tabDel,'Delivery',18,'Bold',INK,54,20);\nconst tabPick = figma.createFrame();\ntabPick.name='Tab · Pickup';\ntabPick.resize(160,64); tabPick.x=216; tabPick.y=24;\ntabPick.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:{r:0.955,g:0.955,b:0.96}}]; tabPick.cornerRadius=10;\ncard.appendChild(tabPick);\ninst('9:13', 20, 20, tabPick, 24);\ntext(tabPick,'Pickup',18,'Bold',GRAY,54,20);\n// Divider\nrect(card, 24, 104, 832, 1, {r:0.93,g:0.93,b:0.93}, 0);\n// Address field (from source Text Field component)\nconst tfInst = figma.getNodeById('1:31').createInstance();\ncard.appendChild(tfInst);\ntfInst.x=24; tfInst.y=128;\ntfInst.resize(560, tfInst.height);\ntfInst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Label').characters='Address';\ntfInst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Placeholder').characters='Enter Your Address';\ninst('9:9', 40, 170, card, 24); // marker icon inside field\n// shift placeholder right of icon\nconst ph = tfInst.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Placeholder');\nph.x = 48;\n// Find Food button\nconst ffb = figma.getNodeById('1:28').createInstance();\ncard.appendChild(ffb);\nffb.resize(220,64);\nffb.x=636; ffb.y=154;\nffb.cornerRadius=10;\nconst ffbT = ffb.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT');\nffbT.characters='Find Food';\nffbT.fontSize=18;\nffbT.x=60; ffbT.y=20;\ninst('9:12', 24, 20, ffb, 24);\n// recolor search icon white? keep neutral — swap to white for contrast\nconst sIcon = ffb.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR');\nfor (const v of sIcon) v.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:WHITE}];\nffb.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.94509804,g:0.44705883,b:0.15686275,a:0.35},offset:{x:0,y:10},radius:20,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n\n// Noodles photo right\nconst noodles = inst('9:39', 1180, 60, heroCon, 480);\nnoodles.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.4,g:0.25,b:0.02,a:0.35},offset:{x:-16,y:40},radius:64,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\nreturn 'hero rebuilt';\n","description":"Rebuild Hero: background photo cover, yellow wash, headline, search card with tabs, address field, Find Food button, noodles photo","fileKey":"vxs2YHWWLo4u0YPXrkb2yt"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2939614a-de6b-46ec-9e1f-7271638640fe","uuid":"b91c4446-e53f-4f99-9a1e-2d5e45e2194f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:22:38.988Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_22_2071c7cf","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
