 to 8.64:1 band — no margins would show. The screenshot showed salad at left edge, orange middle, fries right edge — that IS the full photo stretched? It looked like the full photo visible (salad bowl complete at left, fries complete at right) → fit-like.\n\nWhatever — empirical: screenshot now and adjust based on what I see.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2939614a-de6b-46ec-9e1f-7271638640fe","uuid":"0f28eea5-81a9-434a-899a-ccfa9a27a146","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:40:37.315Z","thinking_duration_ms":12744}
